=== FILE: docs/runbooks/tls-verification.md (modified) ===
@@ -1,0 +1,11 @@
+# TLS verification runbook
+
+Outbound HTTP clients must verify certificates. The reviewer flags these patterns:
+
+| Pattern | Why it is rejected |
+|---|---|
+| `verify=False` | disables certificate validation in requests |
+| `rejectUnauthorized: false` | disables it in Node TLS options |
+| `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` | opens the API to every origin |
+
+If a staging host uses a private CA, add the CA bundle instead of turning verification off.
